@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List catalog products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Create an order that is confirmed
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "sku": "ABC-01",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Create an order that is rejected for insufficient stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Grace Hopper",
  "sku": "ABC-03",
  "quantity": 50
}

### Invalid fields return 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": " ",
  "sku": "ABC-01",
  "quantity": 101
}

### Unknown SKU returns 400 with a sku error
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "sku": "XYZ-99",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Unknown order returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
